# Selects Riedquat on the short-range chart, launches, jumps there, and fights the pirates who come for
# an anarchy's visitors: one is destroyed. The fight was played by a scratch steering program that read
# the targets' positions as it went; what it pressed is recorded here like any other replay.
wait 3
key space; wait 4
key F6; wait 1
down Left; wait 0.1; up Left; wait 0.5   # the cursor to Riedquat, 6.8 light years
key F1; wait 8
digest launched ff812eee3c4bccc0f5b072cb03b61b0248b5a23b3d9076525c55184328bbd0f4
down h; wait 0.2; up h                   # hyperspace: the countdown, then the jump
wait 6
digest arrived d4ac2e5157bf02722ba7156551e21670c4b4e34176b59b274bf3d80baeb685cd
wait 34
digest pirates 26beb263691401ff7990f9cea70f1cfa6bd34983ed8674ebc956c85f4d1f1723
